{"resourceIdentifier":"4616","resourceName":"Shunfeng Erhai Composting project in Yousuo","description":"Shunfeng Erhai Composting project in Yousuo (hereinafter as “the project”) designed to construct an organic fertilizer factory in Songqu Village, Yousuo Town, Eryuan County, Dali Bai Autonomous Prefecture, Yunnan Province, China. The project is owned by Dali Erhai Biological Fertilizer Co., Ltd. The purpose of the project activity is to avoid methane emissions through controlled aerobic treatment by composting of manure.\r\nIn absence of the project, all manure waste produced was left to decay in uncovered anaerobic lagoons, which is the most economic, viable and reasonable for livestock farm owners, and methane would emit to the atmosphere.\r\nThe project is designed to treat livestock manure collected from Niujie Town, Sanyin Town, Zhibi Lake Town, Fengyu Town, Yousuo Town and Dengchuan Town to produce organic fertilizer in Songqu Village. The proposed comprises of composting system and fertilizer packaging system. It is estimated that about 168,088 tons of cattle manure, 127,688 tons of swine manure, 8,842 tons of chicken manure and 66,960 tons of straw will be treated to produce 200,000 tons of organic fertilizer annually. The organic fertilizer produced will be sold to local government, farmers and businesses. Without this project, the manure produced in these farms in project areas remain conditions of uncovered anaerobic lagoons that may bring a larger amount of GHG emissions sent to the atmosphere.\r\nThe project activity will reduce GHG in the atmosphere by avoiding methane emissions through controlled aerobic treatment of organic waste. During the implementation of the project, it is estimated that about 57,435 tCO2e emission reductions will be generated annually, and total 574,350 tCO2e in a 10-year crediting period.","location":{"latitude":26.027558,"longitude":100.123146},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-09-07","endExclusive":"2023-10-08","endInclusive":"2023-10-07"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4616"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Dali Bai Autonomous Prefecture, Yunnan Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Dali Erhai Biological Fertilizer Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Yunnan Province, China"},{"type":"string","value":"+86 13887219081"},{"type":"string","value":"dalierhaifeiye@163.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"57435"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-III.D.,AMS-III.F."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"02/09/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/03/2022 - 29/02/2032"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=96760&IDKEY=ilksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku0989133432040","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PROJ_DESC_PCP_4616_03AUG2023.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-09-07T13:52:13.667Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=95049&IDKEY=8kjalskjf098234kj28098sfkjlf098098kl32lasjdflkj909l131072571","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"shunfeng erhai listing.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-08-03T03:08:13.227Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://re